   ],
   "source": [
    "sanity_check = run_pipeline('what is the total portfolio outstanding by loan category', conn, verified_query_library, database_schema, verbose=True )   # Write the sample query to test the pipeline\n",
    "print(\"\\nPipeline sanity check complete.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(sanity_check['narrative'])\n",
    "display(sanity_check['dataframe'])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "IowbTEAb9UY1"
   },
   "source": [
    "## **Test Cases**\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "KsnhxzuuRL0H"
   },
   "source": [
    "We now execute five test cases to evaluate the query engine end-to-end.\n",
    "- Three test cases exercise the verified template track and two exercise the generated track.\n",
    "- Each test case is followed by ground truth values and observations to compare against."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "-pMl2Qo1Lqtj"
   },
   "source": [
    "### Test Case 1: Sector-Specific NPA Question\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "8Ro-AsX_9UY1"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[1] Intent Classification: route=verified, query_id=VQ1\n",
      "    Reason: The question asks for sector-wise breakdown of outstanding and non-performing amounts, which matches VQ1.\n",
      "[2] Query Construction: loaded from library\n",
      "[3] Validation Gate: passed=True, relevance_confidence=0.9\n",
      "[4] Execute: 10 rows returned\n",
      "[6] Response Generation: confidence=0.9\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "test_1 = run_pipeline(ground_truth['User Query'].iloc[0], conn, verified_query_library, database_schema)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "tk9FI9x29UY1"
   },
   "source": [
    "**Response:**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "WdaxxxD69UY2"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Confidence: 0.9\n",
      "\n",
      "Narrative:\n",
      "The total outstanding amount in the real estate sector is $1,195.12 million, with non-performing assets (NPA) amounting to $89.93 million. This indicates that approximately 7.52% of the real estate portfolio is classified as non-performing.\n",
      "\n",
      "Executed SQL:\n",
      "\n",
      "SELECT\n",
      "    s.sector_name,\n",
      "    ROUND(SUM(l.total_outstanding)/1e6, 2) AS total_outstanding_mn,\n",
      "    ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN l.asset_classification IN ('Substandard', 'Doubtful', 'Loss') \n",
      "        THEN l.total_outstanding ELSE 0 END)/1e6, 2) AS npa_outstanding_mn\n",
      "FROM loan_master l\n",
      "JOIN sector_master s ON l.sector_code = s.sector_code\n",
      "GROUP BY s.sector_name\n",
      "ORDER BY total_outstanding_mn DESC\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "Result data:\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
       "<style scoped>\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n",
       "        vertical-align: middle;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n",
       "        vertical-align: top;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "\n",
       "    .dataframe thead th {\n",
