      "[1] Intent Classification: route=verified, query_id=VQ8\n",
      "    Reason: The question asks for the distribution of overdue loans across DPD buckets, which matches the template for loan distribution across days-past-due buckets.\n",
      "[2] Query Construction: loaded from library\n",
      "[3] Validation Gate: passed=True, relevance_confidence=0.9\n",
      "[4] Execute: 5 rows returned\n",
      "[6] Response Generation: confidence=0.9\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "test_2 = run_pipeline(ground_truth['User Query'].iloc[1], conn, verified_query_library, database_schema) "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "FhgOOyZ-9UY2"
   },
   "source": [
    "**Response:**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "Z1oQRUzY9UY2",
    "scrolled": true
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Confidence: 0.9\n",
      "\n",
      "Narrative:\n",
      "The distribution of our overdue book across DPD buckets is as follows: there are 53 loans in the 1-30 days past due (DPD) bucket with a total outstanding amount of $909.15 million, 37 loans in the 31-60 DPD bucket totaling $835.88 million, 21 loans in the 61-90 DPD bucket amounting to $522.39 million, and 49 loans in the 90+ DPD bucket with a total of $1,183.17 million. The current bucket, which is not considered overdue, has 540 loans totaling $10,795.43 million.\n",
      "\n",
      "Executed SQL:\n",
      "\n",
      "SELECT \n",
      "    CASE\n",
      "        WHEN days_past_due = 0 THEN '0 (Current)'\n",
      "        WHEN days_past_due BETWEEN 1 AND 30 THEN '1-30'\n",
      "        WHEN days_past_due BETWEEN 31 AND 60 THEN '31-60'\n",
      "        WHEN days_past_due BETWEEN 61 AND 90 THEN '61-90'\n",
      "        ELSE '90+'\n",
      "    END AS dpd_bucket, \n",
      "    COUNT(*) AS loan_count, \n",
      "    ROUND(SUM(total_outstanding)/1e6, 2) AS total_outstanding_mn\n",
      "FROM loan_master\n",
      "GROUP BY dpd_bucket\n",
      "ORDER BY MIN(days_past_due)\n",
      "\n",
      "\n",
      "Result data:\n"
     ]
    },
