      "Confidence: 0.95\n",
      "\n",
      "Narrative:\n",
      "Over the last four quarters, the Stage 3 book size has increased significantly, moving from $346.25 million on December 31, 2024, to $1,208.23 million by September 30, 2025. Correspondingly, the expected credit loss (ECL) has also risen, from $131.73 million to $512.40 million during the same period. This trend indicates a substantial escalation in both the size of the Stage 3 portfolio and the associated credit risk.\n",
      "\n",
      "Executed SQL:\n",
      "SELECT \n",
      "    p.reporting_date,\n",
      "    ROUND(SUM(p.ead_amount) / 1e6, 2) AS total_ead_mn,\n",
      "    ROUND(SUM(p.ecl_amount) / 1e6, 2) AS total_ecl_mn\n",
      "FROM \n",
      "    provisioning p\n",
      "WHERE \n",
      "    p.ifrs9_stage = 3\n",
      "GROUP BY \n",
      "    p.reporting_date\n",
      "ORDER BY \n",
